{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-board-detail-tsx","path":"/boards/0teHwDHnWHpw7PpE9mp5/","result":{"pageContext":{"postId":"0teHwDHnWHpw7PpE9mp5","title":"개별 종목에 대한 심리 지표 개발 안내 / Stock Hype Index, KCI, 알리코제약, 주식 하이프 지수","description":"안녕하세요. PSY THINKTANK입니다. 어느덧 2024년의 절반이 지나갔습니다.2024년 하반기 PSYTHINKTANK는 개별 종목에 대한 Stock Hype Index를 출시하고 이에 대한 그레이딩 결과를 무료로 홈페이지에 개시할 예정입니다. 해당 지표는 반기마다 업데이트 될 예…","post":{"createdAt":"2024-07-01T23:44:51.799Z","contentHtml":"<p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-6ebc9773-212e-46a1-b4ef-196e358d46d0\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">안녕하세요. PSY THINKTANK입니다. 어느덧 2024년의 절반이 지나갔습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-24442965-8203-40f5-bd20-7d8e9aa82a4a\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">2024년 하반기 PSYTHINKTANK는 개별 종목에 대한 </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20); background-color: rgb(255, 211, 0);\" id=\"SE-a0b8764c-a90b-407b-af8f-eb64710217b3\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">Stock Hype Index를 출시하고 이에 대한 그레이딩 결과를 무료로 홈페이지에 개시할 예정</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-671bd18a-856d-44d2-a953-264541299a44\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">입니다. 해당 지표는 반기마다 업데이트 될 예정이며, 개별 종목에 대한 시장 분위기를 파악할 수 있는 지표가 될 것으로 기대되고 있습니다.</span></p><blockquote><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-0523a185-20d0-44c2-93aa-7841810c1f64\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-\">개발 배경: PSY THINTKANK 알고리즘 투자 보완</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-588a0186-9d60-45fb-b12a-7a3f7930b43c\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">지금까지 PSY THINKTANK는 알고리즘을 기반 보수적 투자를 집행하였습니다. 대부분의 종목이 좋은 성과를 보였으나 일부 종목은 투자 후 손실을 보고 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-7c382837-0dc0-4737-aa49-42c67bae586e\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-035cefda-77b3-460d-a2c3-27fcb47d9ca7\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">대표적으로 2021년 투자중인 KCI와 알리코제약이 있습니다. 해당 기업들은 이후 주가가 상승하지 못하고 하락세를 보이고 있습니다. 2024년 우리는 이들 종목을 재평가하는 과정 속에서 기업의 펀더맨털에는 어떠한 부정적 변화가 없음을 확인하였습니다. </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20); background-color: rgb(255, 211, 0);\" id=\"SE-6f569b7e-efa2-43a0-8af8-3d08d9c4b808\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">그리고 지속적으로 KCI와 알리코제약에 투자를 하여 해당 기업에 대한 지분을 늘리고 있습니다</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-0aaee333-6ede-4c90-8c70-0c229fac9924\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">. 그럼에도 불구하고 주가가 낮은 이유를 우리는 시장의 심리에 기대어 간접적으로 결론을 내렸습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-4b0cd129-ff21-4a7f-96ca-34e27c62dca3\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20); background-color: rgb(255, 211, 0);\" id=\"SE-c731833b-3a3b-4498-9068-b3f47f6f14d0\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">유동성 장세가 끝나면서 시장의 주목을 받지 못하는 종목일수록 유동성 고갈로 인한 피해가 커졌다는 것입니다</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-6ee45b15-c456-46e0-a8d4-08e52a2065dc\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">. 이에 따라 종목에 대한 심리적 지표를 개발하여 투자할 알고리즘의 필요성을 인지하였고 현재 개발 막마지에 왔습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-536d21fc-002f-437f-92dd-f927ea33efb5\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-f942f09e-5776-4fc7-85f4-d7856780de5b\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">베타테스트를 거쳐 2024년 12월까지 개발을 완료하여 PSY THINTKANK 홈페이지에 개시할 예정입니다.</span></p><blockquote><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-ae9db74f-f0f7-4352-ad29-b9abc0be8614\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-\">주식 하이프 지수(SHI) by PSY THINTKANK</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-f8b42389-55a2-471d-b85c-9d6750bd1815\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">주식 하이프 지수</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-748dc0df-f62b-47be-8216-561e44c0ba20\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\"> (Stock Hype Index)란 특정 주식에 대한 투자자들의 관심과 열기를 측정하는 지표입니다. 이 지표는 다양한 데이터 소스를 분석하여 주식이 얼마나 큰 주목을 받고 있는지를 나타냅니다. 주식 하이프 지수는 다음과 같은 요소를 포함하여 계산됩니다:</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-8baf33cd-7f7d-49f8-8012-3fad29ce2420\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><ol><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-95825322-b13e-4922-bec7-2216df56cc71\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">뉴스 기사</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-29706c1a-d268-4872-a41c-2cdb4bd2a4f3\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 특정 주식에 대한 뉴스 기사 수와 내용 분석.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-98cf3a94-ef53-4a7d-a937-3fdfb0214510\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">소셜 미디어 활동</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-eacee0dc-842c-46f8-af81-5549dd7a1474\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 트위터, 페이스북, 인스타그램 등 소셜 미디어에서의 언급량과 반응.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-3ff2d9a6-6945-4821-9508-5f3136e65a1b\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">검색 트렌드</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-e81a8ef5-8817-4712-83f2-157b4b833a04\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 구글 트렌드와 같은 검색 엔진에서 특정 주식에 대한 검색 빈도.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-1d7484f8-59f1-436f-9124-a749e9b23d73\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">거래량</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-ed2c18f2-e55e-4d3f-884e-6b86891799c3\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 주식의 거래량 변화와 이례적인 거래 활동.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-a7e79096-9ff2-4319-a689-524d5fe9b996\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">포럼 및 커뮤니티 활동</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-ccda2f1a-3cc5-4a8a-8189-870017187bfe\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 주식 관련 포럼(예: 종목토론방)에서의 토론과 관심도.</span></p></li></ol><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-d4f0b8bb-d57a-4fd2-a948-b0e44ef40ee6\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">주식 하이프 지수</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-b319bd8b-6f2c-4f8d-a54e-ce0189d47cdc\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">는 투자자들에게 다음과 같은 유용한 정보를 제공합니다:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-450f8437-71ff-4f9f-9a38-13c435e732fd\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">인기 측정</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-d8782c74-7fbb-426a-b301-eb0b628f0aa0\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 특정 주식이 얼마나 많은 관심을 받고 있는지 평가.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-40ed9f72-a0fe-4ced-a121-d0f302d21829\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">시장 심리 파악</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-89dd1fc1-39c7-4191-b2f3-19794faeef8f\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 투자자들이 어떤 주식에 대해 낙관적이거나 비관적인지 이해.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-4c97e65f-8ab1-4fc7-a126-7f3c7433cf99\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">트렌드 예측</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-4bd279d2-d24b-40b8-b0d4-0ed22a26826a\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">: 특정 주식의 하이프가 앞으로의 가격 변동에 미칠 영향을 예측.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-e0571768-d38f-48fa-acd4-4894f1d882fc\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-9f465ea3-4e55-45ed-9672-595e6a850435\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">이 지표는 투자자들이 감정적인 시장 분위기에서 벗어나 보다 객관적인 투자 결정을 내리는 데 도움을 줄 수 있습니다. 주식 시장의 가격 변동은 종종 투자자들의 감정과 심리에 크게 영향을 받습니다. Stock Hype Index는 투자자들의 관심과 감정적 반응을 측정하여, 시장의 과열 또는 과소평가된 상태를 파악하는 데 도움을 줍니다</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-4ffde234-5d9e-4e12-9020-4c8fe1fcd25f\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-882b778a-4cb3-490a-96e4-c3840f4e4e97\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">검색 트렌드, 소셜 미디어 활동, 뉴스 기사 등을 종합적으로 분석함으로써, Stock Hype Index는 시장의 향후 동향을 예측하는 데 중요한 데이터를 제공합니다. 이는 투자자들이 미리 시장 변화를 준비하고 대응할 수 있게 합니다</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-e568e099-c731-4360-919c-01b64ba958e5\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><blockquote><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-d1c45355-9b18-4f34-b951-5a0849f4347c\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-\">이용 방법 안내</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-8b32aeec-65f1-41f0-97cd-f9febfa122d1\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">주식 하이프 지수에 대한 변화량을 그레이딩하여 홈페이지에 공개할 예정입니다. 변화량만을 측정하기 때문에 절대적인 기업의 규모와 상관없이 개별 기업에 대한 인사이트를 제공할 수 있습니다. 자신이 투자하고 있는 기업에 대해서 시장의 관심도가 낮아지고 있는지 또는 증가하고 있는지 그 추세를 확인하고 이러한 추세를 주가를 예측하는 데 활용될 수 있을 것이라 기대되고 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-3ae4ba08-333d-4e95-9541-b7eaa1af41bd\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-9dcf482f-1850-4ca7-9708-d262fc4b52c4\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">1 . PSY THINKTANK 공식 홈페이지 접속</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-c3124657-0561-473f-93c5-d9a8e34c6142\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">PSY THINTKANK 홈페이지 접속 (</span><a href=\"http://www.psythinktank.com)/\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-9806c744-463a-45d5-bc74-c34b16aceacd\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">www.psythinktank.com)</span></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-4765bf44-2cb7-4a5a-a91c-f2c594967482\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">2 상단 종목검색 클릭</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-c911a9f0-7a26-4888-8475-68a8d3b2884b\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">회원가입 및 로그인상태여야 종목 검색을 할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-a96c6348-bd9e-4fc3-a77b-ed81086365fe\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 120, 203);\" id=\"SE-79d77f47-7c8f-4c34-ad76-009bfd29964c\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">3. 자신이 검색하고 싶은 주식 종목 클릭</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-82ca0adf-6dc7-437e-8243-c8d4f813b844\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">기업에 대한 기본 정보 및 하단 PSY THINKTANK 빅데이터 평가 확인. 주식 하이프 지수는 연말까지 추가될 예정입니다. 현재는 성장성과 지배구조 그리고 이사회 안정성에 대한 지표를 확인할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummaruburi, arial, 마루부리, nanummaruburi, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(20, 20, 20);\" id=\"SE-63af84d6-6661-4818-985a-f3b06186b8fc\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanummaruburi\">​</span></p>","authorUid":"legacy_8","authorName":"psythinktank","authorRole":"manager","notice":true,"category":"domestic","views":1356,"title":"개별 종목에 대한 심리 지표 개발 안내 / Stock Hype Index, KCI, 알리코제약, 주식 하이프 지수"}}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}